# Versuz environment.
#
# LOCAL DEMO (default, zero setup): leave everything unset — the app runs on
# an in-browser seeded save, no network, no login.
#
# CLOUD MODE (the live site): set all three and users sign in with
# email + password; progress lives in Supabase and follows the account.
# On Vercel, set these as project Environment Variables.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_DATA_BACKEND=supabase
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
